  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Typography Choices**\n\nI\'ve been exploring typography options. I\'m leaning toward using Cinzel for a serif font, it\'s elegant and appropriate. For a sans-serif, I\'m considering alternatives to Satoshi like Inter, Manrope, or Montserrat since Satoshi isn\'t a Google font.\n\n\n**Defining Visual Identity**\n\nI\'m now building the initial site structure and considering layout and color choices. I\'m focusing on a \"Dark Luxury\" aesthetic with technical warmth, given the logo\'s orange glow on dark backgrounds. I\'m prioritizing dark themes, with off-white sections to add contrast. I\'ve chosen `Cinzel` and `Inter` from `next/font/google` for typography and I\'m configuring the `app/layout.tsx` file accordingly. I\'m planning out the navbar, footer, and the various pages. It\'s looking like a single-page scrolling layout.\n\n\n"
