    modified_response: "I\'ve built the website for **WebOvens**! I took the inspiration closely from the brand boards and your descriptions to create a highly distinctive, professional, and polished digital presence. \n\nHere\'s an overview of what was implemented:\n\n1. **Brand Aesthetic & Identity**: \n   - I utilized a \"Dark Luxury / Atmospheric\" visual recipe to make the orange \"flame\" colors stand out against a dark navy/charcoal background (`#0B1320`). \n   - Typography uses **Cinzel** (elegant serif) for impactful, classy headings combined with **Inter** (clean sans-serif) for modern readability\342\200\224reflecting both passion and high-end engineering.\n\n2. **Responsive & Modern Navigation**: A sticky header with a stylized \"oven\" brand emblem and a smooth-scrolling experience across both desktop and mobile devices.\n\n3. **Key Sections**:\n   - **Hero Section**: Features a massive typographic statement (\"We code apps. You serve success.\") with bold Calls-to-Action to grab visitor attention instantly.\n   - **Services (\"Our Ingredients\")**: Emphasizes the brand\'s core concepts\342\200\224Trust, Quality, Growth, Impact\342\200\224and lists Web Platform, UI/UX Design, and Custom Software offerings.\n   - **Portfolio**: A beautifully animated showcase section ready to display your digital creations with a cinematic fade-in layout.\n   - **Insights (Blog)**: A dedicated area to share industry knowledge and company updates with a sleek preview list.\n   - **Contact & CTA**: A robust form area encouraging inquiries with a backdrop inspired by your brand\'s fiery concept.\n\n4. **SEO Optimization**: Updated the global metadata to properly index \"WebOvens\" with a descriptive summary pointing towards top-tier web development and UI design services to improve search engine visibility.\n\nTake a look around the live preview\342\200\224everything is fully animated and responsive. If you\'d like to refine any colors, tweak the placeholder images for your real portfolio, or expand the blog into a fully multi-page setup, just let me know!"
