  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Editorial Aesthetic\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Editorial Aesthetic\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"w-[1024px] h-[768px] bg-[#0A0A0A] text-[#F5F5F0] font-sans flex flex-col overflow-hidden relative\\\">\\n  <header class=\\\"flex justify-between items-baseline p-10 border-b border-white/10 z-20\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex flex-col\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"text-[32px] font-bold tracking-tighter leading-none serif uppercase\\\">Orbital.</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-[10px] tracking-[0.3em] opacity-60 uppercase mt-1 italic\\\">Creative Agency & Digital Lab</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <nav class=\\\"flex gap-12 text-[11px] font-medium tracking-widest uppercase\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"hover:text-blue-400\\\">Services</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"hover:text-blue-400\\\">Journal</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"hover:text-blue-400\\\">Archive</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"text-blue-500 underline underline-offset-8\\\">Contact</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"flex-grow grid grid-cols-12 gap-0 relative\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-center px-12 z-10\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"relative\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.5em] mb-6 opacity-40\\\">01 / ESTABLISHED 2018</p>\\n        <h1 class=\\\"text-[130px] leading-[0.85] font-black tracking-tighter mb-8\\\">\\n          BEYOND<br/>\\n          <span class=\\\"italic font-light text-blue-500\\\">ORDINARY</span>\\n        </h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"max-w-md text-[16px] leading-relaxed opacity-80\\\">\\n          We specialize in crafting bespoke digital experiences for world-class brands. \\n          Focusing on high-performance design that commands attention and drives growth.\\n        </p>\\n        <div class=\\\"mt-12 flex items-center gap-8\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"px-10 py-5 bg-white text-black font-bold uppercase text-[12px] tracking-widest hover:bg-blue-500 hover:text-white\\\">Start a Project</button>\\n          <span class=\\\"w-24 h-[1px] bg-white/20\\\"></span>\\n          <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest border-b border-white/40 pb-1\\\">View Showreel</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"col-span-5 relative\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#111] border-l border-white/10\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"p-12 h-full flex flex-col\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex-grow overflow-hidden\\\">\\n            <p class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-8 opacity-40\\\">Featured Case Studies</p>\\n            <div class=\\\"space-y-12\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"group cursor-pointer\\\">\\n                <p class=\\\"text-[11px] opacity-40 mb-2 italic\\\">Architecture / 2024</p>\\n                <h3 class=\\\"text-3xl font-light group-hover:text-blue-400\\\">Mono-Luxe Spaces</h3>\\n                <p class=\\\"text-[14px] mt-2 opacity-60 leading-tight\\\">Award-winning 3D portfolio for high-end real estate developers.</p>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\\\"group cursor-pointer\\\">\\n                <p class=\\\"text-[11px] opacity-40 mb-2 italic\\\">eCommerce / 2023</p>\\n                <h3 class=\\\"text-3xl font-light group-hover:text-blue-400\\\">Velvet & Bone</h3>\\n                <p class=\\\"text-[14px] mt-2 opacity-60 leading-tight\\\">Redefining the online luxury retail experience.</p>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"pt-12 border-t border-white/10\\\">\\n             <p class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6 opacity-40\\\">Insights & Thoughts</p>\\n             <div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-4\\\">\\n                <div class=\\\"w-12 h-12 bg-white/5 flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] italic\\\">01</div>\\n                <div>\\n                  <h4 class=\\\"text-[14px] font-medium leading-tight\\\">Why Minimalism is the Future of Conversion Optimization</h4>\\n                  <p class=\\\"text-[11px] mt-1 text-blue-400 italic\\\">Read Article</p>\\n                </div>\\n             </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <footer class=\\\"p-10 border-t border-white/10 flex justify-between items-center z-20\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-16\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest opacity-40 mb-2\\\">Social</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex gap-6 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-tighter\\\">\\n          <a href=\\\"#\\\">Behance</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"#\\\">Dribbble</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"#\\\">Instagram</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest opacity-40 mb-2\\\">Location</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-tighter\\\">Berlin / Global Remote</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"text-right\\\">\\n       <p class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest opacity-40\\\">Inquiries</p>\\n       <p class=\\\"text-[18px] font-light\\\">hello@orbital.studio</p>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-[300px] font-black opacity-[0.02] pointer-events-none z-0\\\">\\n    ORBIT\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Editorial Aesthetic\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Editorial Aesthetic\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"w-[1024px] h-[768px] bg-[#0A0A0A] text-[#F5F5F0] font-sans flex flex-col overflow-hidden relative\\\">\\n  <header class=\\\"flex justify-between items-baseline p-10 border-b border-white/10 z-20\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex flex-col\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"text-[32px] font-bold tracking-tighter leading-none serif uppercase\\\">Orbital.</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-[10px] tracking-[0.3em] opacity-60 uppercase mt-1 italic\\\">Creative Agency & Digital Lab</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <nav class=\\\"flex gap-12 text-[11px] font-medium tracking-widest uppercase\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"hover:text-blue-400\\\">Services</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"hover:text-blue-400\\\">Journal</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"hover:text-blue-400\\\">Archive</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"text-blue-500 underline underline-offset-8\\\">Contact</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"flex-grow grid grid-cols-12 gap-0 relative\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-center px-12 z-10\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"relative\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.5em] mb-6 opacity-40\\\">01 / ESTABLISHED 2018</p>\\n        <h1 class=\\\"text-[130px] leading-[0.85] font-black tracking-tighter mb-8\\\">\\n          BEYOND<br/>\\n          <span class=\\\"italic font-light text-blue-500\\\">ORDINARY</span>\\n        </h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"max-w-md text-[16px] leading-relaxed opacity-80\\\">\\n          We specialize in crafting bespoke digital experiences for world-class brands. \\n          Focusing on high-performance design that commands attention and drives growth.\\n        </p>\\n        <div class=\\\"mt-12 flex items-center gap-8\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"px-10 py-5 bg-white text-black font-bold uppercase text-[12px] tracking-widest hover:bg-blue-500 hover:text-white\\\">Start a Project</button>\\n          <span class=\\\"w-24 h-[1px] bg-white/20\\\"></span>\\n          <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest border-b border-white/40 pb-1\\\">View Showreel</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"col-span-5 relative\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#111] border-l border-white/10\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"p-12 h-full flex flex-col\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex-grow overflow-hidden\\\">\\n            <p class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-8 opacity-40\\\">Featured Case Studies</p>\\n            <div class=\\\"space-y-12\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"group cursor-pointer\\\">\\n                <p class=\\\"text-[11px] opacity-40 mb-2 italic\\\">Architecture / 2024</p>\\n                <h3 class=\\\"text-3xl font-light group-hover:text-blue-400\\\">Mono-Luxe Spaces</h3>\\n                <p class=\\\"text-[14px] mt-2 opacity-60 leading-tight\\\">Award-winning 3D portfolio for high-end real estate developers.</p>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\\\"group cursor-pointer\\\">\\n                <p class=\\\"text-[11px] opacity-40 mb-2 italic\\\">eCommerce / 2023</p>\\n                <h3 class=\\\"text-3xl font-light group-hover:text-blue-400\\\">Velvet & Bone</h3>\\n                <p class=\\\"text-[14px] mt-2 opacity-60 leading-tight\\\">Redefining the online luxury retail experience.</p>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"pt-12 border-t border-white/10\\\">\\n             <p class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6 opacity-40\\\">Insights & Thoughts</p>\\n             <div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-4\\\">\\n                <div class=\\\"w-12 h-12 bg-white/5 flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] italic\\\">01</div>\\n                <div>\\n                  <h4 class=\\\"text-[14px] font-medium leading-tight\\\">Why Minimalism is the Future of Conversion Optimization</h4>\\n                  <p class=\\\"text-[11px] mt-1 text-blue-400 italic\\\">Read Article</p>\\n                </div>\\n             </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <footer class=\\\"p-10 border-t border-white/10 flex justify-between items-center z-20\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-16\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest opacity-40 mb-2\\\">Social</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex gap-6 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-tighter\\\">\\n          <a href=\\\"#\\\">Behance</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"#\\\">Dribbble</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"#\\\">Instagram</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest opacity-40 mb-2\\\">Location</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-tighter\\\">Berlin / Global Remote</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"text-right\\\">\\n       <p class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest opacity-40\\\">Inquiries</p>\\n       <p class=\\\"text-[18px] font-light\\\">hello@orbital.studio</p>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-[300px] font-black opacity-[0.02] pointer-events-none z-0\\\">\\n    ORBIT\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    }
  }
}
