rifying the site structure based on the provided image and prompt requirements. I\'m noting the hero, services, and featured work sections. I\'m also planning the slogan (testimonial) and footer logos sections, followed by the main footer info. The contact and blog sections aren\'t explicitly shown, but I\'ll integrate them with the specified aesthetic for now.\n\n\n"
